" end="1:00.590">黄</span><span begin="1:00.590" end="1:01.347">昏</span><span begin="1:01.347" end="1:01.522">終</span><span begin="1:01.522" end="1:01.959">わ</span><span begin="1:01.959" end="1:02.107">り</span><span begin="1:02.107" end="1:02.619">迎</span><span begin="1:02.619" end="1:02.840">え</span><span begin="1:02.840" end="1:03.023">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">朝霞流光溢彩 漫长幽暗迎来终章</span></p><p begin="1:03.281" end="1:09.662" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.281" end="1:04.082">誰</span><span begin="1:04.082" end="1:04.330">か</span><span begin="1:04.330" end="1:04.772">が</span><span begin="1:04.772" end="1:05.331">教</span><span begin="1:05.331" end="1:05.608">え</span><span begin="1:05.608" end="1:05.840">て</span><span begin="1:05.840" end="1:06.031">く</span><span begin="1:06.031" end="1:06.255">れ</span><span begin="1:06.255" end="1:06.503">た</span><span begin="1:06.898" end="1:07.094">夜</span><span begin="1:07.094" end="1:07.290">明</span><span begin="1:07.290" end="1:07.487">け</span><span begin="1:07.487" end="1:07.707">を</span><span begin="1:07.707" end="1:07.926">告</span><span begin="1:07.926" end="1:08.215">げ</span><span begin="1:08.215" end="1:08.413">る</span><span begin="1:08.413" end="1:09.069">言</span><span begin="1:09.069" end="1:09.348">葉</span><span begin="1:09.348" end="1:09.662">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那是谁曾教予我 宣告拂晓到来的话语</span></p><p begin="1:17.309" end="1:24.201" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.309" end="1:17.567">射</span><span begin="1:17.567" end="1:17.824">し</span><span begin="1:17.824" end="1:17.958">込</span><span begin="1:17.958" end="1:18.184">む</span><span begin="1:18.184" end="1:18.819">光</span><span begin="1:18.819" end="1:19.134">が</span><span begin="1:19.134" end="1:19.549">大</span><span begin="1:19.549" end="1:19.701">地</span><span begin="1:19.701" end="1:19.985">を</span><span begin="1:19.985" end="1:20.212">照</span><span begin="1:20.212" end="1:20.